 gamepadii GP2040-CE pads
┌ Pad ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ XInput (likely)                                                                                  │
│ usb id   045e:028e                                                                               │
│ port     bus 3, port 3-1, device 7                                                               │
│ note     045e:028e is also used by the Xbox 360 controller and its clones                        │
│ channel  none: stock GP2040-CE (no answer to HELLO)                                              │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
┌ Input mode ────────────────────────────────────┐┌ Profile ───────────────────────────────────────┐
│  XInput               current                  ││ Profiles switch over the control channel of    │
│  Nintendo Switch                               ││ the gamepadii firmware. On stock GP2040-CE,    │
│  PS3                                           ││ use the pad's profile hotkeys.                 │
│▶ Keyboard                                      ││                                                │
│  PS4                                           ││                                                │
│  Xbox One                                      ││                                                │
│  Sega Genesis/MegaDrive Mini                   ││                                                │
│  NEOGEO mini                                   ││                                                │
│  PC Engine/Turbografx 16 Mini                  ││                                                │
│  EGRET II mini                                 ││                                                │
│  ASTROCITY Mini                                ││                                                │
│  Playstation Classic                           ││                                                │
│  Original Xbox                                 ││                                                │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────┘└────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
┌ Do this on the pad ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ First switch it to web-config: hold S2 (Start) while plugging the pad in, or hold S2+B3+B4       │
│ (Start+X+Y) for 4 seconds while it runs (only those buttons).                                    │
│ These are logical buttons, so on a remapped profile they may be other keys; once the pad is in   │
│ web-config, gamepadii remembers its profiles and names the keys next time.                       │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
⠋ switching to Keyboard: waiting for the pad to show up in web-config or Keyboard, 60 s left  q quit
